	(text "Inductor Selection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.854 134.366 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "204c3393-7742-4149-bb0b-39628dcda557")
	)
	(text "Feed-forward Capacitor"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 135.128 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "40122a71-22ca-4682-b34f-7c5075a20aed")
	)
	(text "On input, 10uF + 220nF and output 4x22uF were selected \nas per Design Requirements section in LMR33630 datasheet. \n\nTarget switching frequency is 400kHz, Vout is 5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 93.218 125.984 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "44759867-f5f8-44c1-9765-42ad2c3728c1")
	)
	(text "Chosen based on the inductance and saturation current.\n\nInductance is based on the pk-pk ripple current, \nand chosen to be in the range of 30% of the max load current\nL = (Vin-Vout) / (fsw * 0.3 * Iout) * (Vout/Vin)\n\nIout =~ 1.5 A (1.25A firing circuit, ~150mA logic)\n\nL = (8.4-5) / (400k * 0.3 * 1.5) * (5/8.4)\nL =~ 11.2 uH\n\nSelect L = 10uH ; in between TI's reccomended 8uH and theoretical 11.2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.456 148.844 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "47af6792-bb33-4e16-b41e-270763c59963")
	)
	(text "FB Resistive Voltage Divider\n\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.212 122.428 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a4b55a3c-9bdf-497f-9f40-80b370978059")
	)
	(text "Sets output voltage.\nVref is nominally 1V, fix R32 at 100k as per datasheet section 9.2.2.3\n\nR33 = R32 / (Vout / Vref - 1)\nR33 = 100k / (5 / 1 - 1) = 25k ~ 24.9k (standard)\n\n\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.496 130.302 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b5f62592-5c25-489a-8ccc-90f466083109")
	)
	(text "A feed-forward capacitor is used to improve load transient response, forming a high-pass filter\\\n\nCff < (Vout * Cout) / 120 * R32 * sqrt(Vref/Vout)\nC15 < (5 * 88u) / 120 * 100k * 0.4472 <~ 81.99 pF \n\nAccounting for capacitor derating and looking at standard E12 values:\nCff = 56pF (well below upper limit)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.988 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cec5e318-73ab-4dda-b041-26dc803fcbd7")
	)
	(text "Input & Output Capacitors\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105.918 120.142 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ec220d6e-0eca-4d7e-afe7-0e3aae34c3c6")
	)
